No adult entertainment establishment, business or use restricted hereunder shall be located:

- 1. Within 1,000 feet of a residence on any parcel of land which is zoned as R-I, R-II, A-I/R-III or P-R-D under the Clermont Zoning Ordinance as amended, or any combination thereof;

- 2. Within 1,000 feet of any parcel of land upon which a governmental building gimultaneously owned and occupied by such government, library, civic center, hospital, public park or neighborhood playground is located;

- 3. Within 1,000 feet of any parcel of land upon which a church, school, educational institution, or religious institution is located;

- 4. Within 1,000 feet of any parcel of land upon which another establishment regulated or defined hereunder is located;

15

- 4. Within any zoning category other than the following category: Highway Business (HB).

Each application for license hereunder for which there is no existing license(s) for the operation of an adult entertainment establishment or business then in effect shall include a blue line copy of a surveyor’s plat, 8 1/2" x 11" in size, with a scale of 1" per 200’, showing the proposed location and the location of all customer entries in relation and distance measured as provided in this Ordinance, to all real property and buildings on such real property which fall within the above distance requirements, together with the zoning classifications and present uses of all real property and the proposed location.

After issuance of any license, no change in the location of the building on the premises or customer entry location shall be made which would affect compliance with any distance requirements of this Ordinance.

